__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">T&amp;C should be defined according to the specific needs and nature of each website. For example, a website offering products to customers in e-commerce transactions requires T&amp;C that are different from the T&amp;C of a website only providing information (like a blog, a landing page, and so on). &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">T&amp;C provide you as the website owner the ability to protect yourself from potential legal exposure, but this may differ from jurisdiction to jurisdiction, so make sure to receive local legal advice if you are trying to protect yourself from legal exposure.</p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lwj5nzur14":{"html":"<h2 class=\"font_5 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:19px;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">What to include in the T&amp;C document</span></h2>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-lwj5nzus3":{"html":"<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">Generally speaking, T&amp;C often address these types of issues: Who is allowed to use the website; the possible payment methods; a declaration that the website owner may change his or her offering in the future; the types of warranties the website owner gives his or her customers; a reference to issues of intellectual property or copyrights, where relevant; the website owner&rsquo;s right to suspend or cancel a member&rsquo;s account; and much, much more.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">To learn more about this, check out our article &ldquo;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"https://support.wix.com/en/article/creating-a-terms-and-conditions-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Creating a Terms and Conditions Policy</a></span>&rdquo;.</p>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"}}}},"nicknameToCompIdMaps":{}}